    💭 A query with a bound parameter, read row by row.
    🔺📝 database 🔤SELECT glyph, name, year FROM emoji WHERE year < ? ORDER BY year, name🔤❗️ ➡️ old
    🔺📌 old 1 🆕💎▶️🔢 2018❗️❗️
    😀 🔤Emoji from before 2018:🔤❗️
    🔁 🔺👣 old❗️ 🍇
      😀 🔤  🧲🐽old 0❗️🧲 🧲🐽old 1❗️🧲 (🧲🐽old 2❗️🧲)🔤❗️
    🍉

    💭 Aggregates return an integer and a real column. AVG skips the NULL score.
    🔺📝 database 🔤SELECT COUNT(*) AS count, AVG(score) AS average FROM emoji🔤❗️ ➡️ statistics
    🔺👣 statistics❗️ ➡️ hasStatistics
    😀 🔤🧲🏷statistics 0❗️🧲 = 🧲🐽statistics 0❗️🧲, 🧲🏷statistics 1❗️🧲 = 🧲🐽statistics 1❗️🧲🔤❗️

    💭 An update, and how many rows it changed.
    🔺🔨 database 🔤UPDATE emoji SET score = score + 0.5 WHERE year > 2015 AND score IS NOT NULL🔤❗️
    😀 🔤Updated 🧲✏️database❗️🧲 row(s)🔤❗️

    💭 sqlite3_exec calls a C callback for each row, which calls this closure.
